  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Research Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Strategic Research Fund (SRF) will help underpin DFID and HMG&#x2019;s strategy and investments in Ethiopia through targeted, short-term analysis and research.  Specific pieces of work under the Fund may include research, policy advice, and capacity building such as short term surge support to government offices or other institutions, and training seminars.   The programme will support stronger partnerships with Government of Ethiopia, Ethiopian research institutions, and civil society, providing a foundation to influence policy and maximise the impact and value for money of HMG&#x2019;s work.</narrative>
  </description>
